    ans:["That is a fair question, and I will have the numbers by Friday.", "The record will show what I said, and not what the member heard.", "I am not the witness to ask. Ask the clerk.", "Section four does not say that, and I will read it aloud if I must."]},
  caucus:{open:["Doors shut. We leave this room with one line on {t}.", "Right. {t}, and then we go out and say the same thing.", "Phones down. I want to hear who is wobbling."],
