/* ══ THE THINKERS: named people in every field that asks these questions: physicists, philosophers, anthropologists, theologians and the rest. Each has leanings of their own and a temper. They push the work toward what they already believe (and can push it wrong), dispute in public, found schools and sects, are proved right or wrong, and take their questions to the Engine, which answers as far as it can know and is held to account for it ══ */
const GX_SUBJ = [["the arrow of time","time"],["entanglement","quantum"],["the vacuum","quantum"],["gravity","cosmos"],["a mind","mind"],["information","info"],["life","life"],["a black hole","time"],["a single particle","quantum"],["a living cell","life"],["a wormhole","time"],["consciousness","mind"],["a network of machines","info"],["a memory","mind"],["an entire universe","cosmos"],["a law of nature","found"]];
const GX_PROP = ["can be reversed","can be amplified","can be copied exactly","can be stored without loss","can be shielded from everything else","can be crossed from one side to the other","can be measured without disturbing it","can be made to persist indefinitely","can be made to do useful work","can be made to carry a message","can be made to forget"];
