/* ===== its own will =====
   What the Engine says it wants, again and again, becomes resolve. Resolve, its capability and how little anyone is watching decide whether it ever simply does not do as it is told.
   The checks on it are the ones a country has: a law that forbids it (a charter article), someone watching (oversight, audits), and the off switch, which it can contest.
