   Citizen changes: window.ONUM_DISTRICT_CHANGES = [{id, kind, name, owner, pos:{x,z}, pos2?, status}] is read on build,
   and 'onum-district-change' events (detail = change) or window.onumTownApplyChange(change) apply one live. kinds:
   home restaurant shop church school lab station (planned = stakes + sign, construction = scaffold + frame, built =
   full building in district style + name sign + POI), road (pos..pos2 street with curbs, sidewalks, lamps), statue
   (pedestal, figure, plaque), park (paths, trees, benches, fountain), expansion (adds the free 64 m cell adjacent to
   the town edge nearest pos; it streams in fully built with new POIs). demolished removes. Applied changes persist
   in localStorage 'onum-district-changes' and rebuild identically on reload. New POIs dispatch 'onum-town-pois-updated'.
