}catch(e){ try{ console.warn("NEPTUNE-DISTRICT block", e); }catch(e2){} }
/* NEPTUNE-DISTRICT END */
/* NEPTUNE-LOCALPARTY BEGIN — regular local party meetings at home: a weekly district meeting and a monthly
   state party meeting, with constituents and the lower elected officials of the district and state (state
   reps, state senators, mayors, county officials). Officials are generated deterministically from the
   state and district (names, party, faction, agenda, allies and rivals) and kept in the save with their
   warmth to you. Agenda items come from JUPITER's feeds (window.ONUM_SUGGESTIONS / "onum-suggestion",
   window.ONUM_DISTRICT_CHANGES / "onum-district-change"), else local issues. Meetings run on the
   NEPTUNE-SITTINGS engine (debate, choices, stance meters, ruling, recap) and pay out in local standing,
