   roll-call board. Every button goes through window.onumSession (requestFloor, yieldFloor, vote, gavel... whatever it
   offers); nothing here changes the session itself. With no ONUM_SESSION, or one that is not open, nothing is drawn.
   Accepted shape (all optional): {open|active, title, room, seats:[{id,name,party,state,present}], floor:id|{id},
   chair:id, gavel:{at,kind}|bool, clock:{left|remaining|seconds, label}, queue:[id|{id,name}], roll:{open, aye|yes, no|nay,
